{"vid":"M2HEdFy3LTE","source":"M2HEdFy3LTE.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":1.2,"txt":"It was a really cool experience. I got"},{"t":3,"txt":"to meet a lot of really neat people that"},{"t":4.4,"txt":"have done really impressive stuff in"},{"t":6,"txt":"their career."},{"t":6.6,"txt":">> It's just an expanded networking"},{"t":9.2,"txt":"community."},{"t":10.8,"txt":"Bonded really well with fellow"},{"t":12.9,"txt":"classmates and also really good to put"},{"t":16.2,"txt":"AWS staff names to faces."},{"t":19.5,"txt":">> I believe getting involved with the AWS"},{"t":22.4,"txt":"section meetings not only helps you"},{"t":25,"txt":"network and meet new people, but it can"},{"t":27,"txt":"also create a job opportunity, open up"},{"t":29.4,"txt":"new doors."},{"t":30.4,"txt":">> This has been probably the most"},{"t":32.8,"txt":"rewarding and beneficial experience I"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"have had personally and the opportunity"},{"t":38.2,"txt":"for personal growth in leadership, but"},{"t":40.7,"txt":"just connecting with other leaders and"},{"t":42.6,"txt":"having that same energy in the room was"},{"t":46,"txt":"very powerful and we just the way we"},{"t":48.4,"txt":"grew together and the way we could"},{"t":50.5,"txt":"bounce ideas off of each other and again"},{"t":52.4,"txt":"just that energy that we had"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"collectively was very empowering and"},{"t":56.4,"txt":"looking forward to what we can do with"},{"t":58.6,"txt":"that."},{"t":59,"txt":">> We did a lot of brainstorming and came"},{"t":61,"txt":"up with different things that we're"},{"t":62.2,"txt":"going to go back and implement within"},{"t":64.2,"txt":"our district or within our section. To"},{"t":66.9,"txt":"me, I was looking for encouragement to"},{"t":69.7,"txt":"step up and lead in my section and in"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"AWS in general and I think we all got"},{"t":75.2,"txt":"that. We all encouraged and motivated"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"when we left."}],"words":[{"t":1.24,"w":"It"},{"t":1.3